{
  "description": "This is Part 2 to the QIAseq FastSelect 5s, 16s, 23s Protocol. This protocol is used to perform the addition of samples with mastermix into a plate.\nPart 1 to this protocol is the normalization of samples.\nPart 3 to this protocol is the Extraction and Clean-Up steps.\nLinks:\n Part 1: Sample Normalization\n Part 2: QIAseq FastSelect 5s, 16s, 23s Fragmentation\n* Part 3: QIAseq FastSelect 5s, 16s, 23s Extraction",
  "tags": [
    "NGS LIBRARY PREP",
    "QIASeq FastSelect"
  ],
  "labware": [
    {
